===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|ru|sla-pro|*moldъ}}, from {{der|ine-pro|ru|*(h₂)moldus||soft, weak}}, whence English {{m|en|mild}}, {{m|en|melt}} and {{m|en|mollify}}. {{doublet|ru|младо́й}}, a borrowing from Old Church Slavonic.

